:: StealClothes [nobr noreturn] {"position":"4125,950","size":"100,100"}
<<run setup.HuntController.markStealClothesTriggered()>>
<<run setup.activateTool("uvl")>>

<<thought>>While focusing on your device, you suddenly felt a hard push from behind. Before you could understand what happened, the ground came veeeeery close. *Bang*<</thought>><br>
<<mc>>Ouch!<</mc>> <<thought>>You tried to break the fall with your hands, but you didn't react in time. The impact was too strong, and it knocked you out for a few moments.<</thought>>

<<set _stealOptions to setup.Wardrobe.availableStealTargets()>>

/% Each Steal* include strips its garment + stashes a per-piece pin on the floor plan via setup.HuntController.stealClothes(piece), so the find-stolen-clothes UI surfaces each piece independently somewhere in the house (overlapping allowed). The shirt branch has no media so it calls stealClothes directly. %/
<<if _stealOptions.length gt 0>>
	<<set _stealOption to _stealOptions.random()>>

	<<if _stealOption is "panties">>
		<<include "StealPanties">>
		<<mc>>Ugh... My head... Did it just push me to the ground? Wait... Where are my panties? Did it take them? What an asshole.<br><b>Maybe I can find them somewhere in the house.</b>Shit. This place is driving me crazy.<</mc>>

	<<elseif _stealOption is "bra">>
		<<include "StealBra">>
		<<mc>>Ugh... My head... Did it just push me to the ground? Wait... Where is my bra? Did it take it? What an asshole.<br><b>Maybe I can find them somewhere in the house.</b>Shit. This place is driving me crazy.<</mc>>

	<<elseif _stealOption is "outerwear">>
		<<if setup.Wardrobe.worn(setup.WardrobeSlot.TSHIRT)>>
			<<run setup.HuntController.stealClothes("shirt")>>
		<</if>>
		<<if setup.Wardrobe.hasBottomWorn()>>
			<<include "StealBottomOuter">>
		<</if>>
		<<mc>>Ugh... My head... Wait... Where are my clothes? Did it take them? What the hell?<br><b>Maybe I can find them somewhere in the house.</b>Shit. This place is driving me crazy.<</mc>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

<br>
<br>
@@.backbtn; [[Continue|$return]]@@<br>

<<includeStyle>>
<<includeStyle2>>
<<addclass "body" "style-steal-clothes">>

<<done>>
	<<addclass ".linkselector" "disabled-link">>
<</done>>
